  ST.facts_only ? 'JUST THE FACTS: essentials only. No rhetorical questions, no teaser, no for_you segments, no scene-setting. Crisp sentences, context only where a number would otherwise be meaningless.' : null,
  ST.busy ? 'LITTLE TIME TODAY: get to the point immediately. No teaser, lead with the most important fact, transitions of three words or fewer.' : null,
  P.explain_terms ? 'Explain each technical term in a few plain words the first time it appears.' : 'Do not define common financial terms.',
